<title>USA: IFX Corp names Donka to be CFO.</title>
<headline>IFX Corp names Donka to be CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>IFX Corp said Thursday it named assistant chief financial officer Christina Donka as chief financial officer and secretary of the company.</p>
<p>Donka replaces Allyson Laackman, who resigned as chief financial officer effective June 9, the company said.</p>
